<title>USA: Environmental Tech buys ex-CEO's shares.</title>
<headline>Environmental Tech buys ex-CEO's shares.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, N.J. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Technologies Corp said Monday it had bought 270,000 of its shares from its former chief executive, Brian McCagg, at $8 each.</p>
<p>McCagg resigned as chief executive April 4.</p>
<p>The company said it will retire the shares.</p>
